  "sellingType": "By Private Treaty",
  "description": "New to the Market \n\nLUCANHILL, BELCARRA, CASTLEBAR, CO. MAYO\nF23 DY94\n\n4 BEDROOM DETACHED RESIDENCE ON c.0.50 ACRE MATURE SITE\n\nGuide Price: €225,000\n\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this spacious four-bedroom detached residence situated at Lucanhill, Belcarra, Castlebar, Co. Mayo.\n\nSet on approximately 0.50 acres of mature grounds, the property enjoys an excellent countryside location approximately 4 miles from Castlebar and 3 miles from Belcarra, offering the benefits of rural living while remaining within convenient reach of Castlebar and surrounding amenities.\n\nThe residence is in need of refurbishment and internal/external redecoration, but offers substantial accommodation and excellent potential for a purchaser wishing to renovate and create a family home to their own specification.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the large detached garage/outbuilding, providing excellent additional storage, workshop or hobby space.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGround Floor\n\nEntrance hallway, sitting room with open fireplace, kitchen/dining room, separate WC with wash-hand basin and two double bedrooms.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nLanding, bathroom, two double bedrooms, hot press and attic storage area.\n\nEXTERNALLY\n\nThe residence stands on approximately 0.50 acres of mature grounds with a tarmac driveway extending to the front and side of the property.\n\nThe property benefits from a large detached garage/outbuilding, providing substantial additional storage and excellent workshop potential.\n\nThere are lawn and garden areas to the front, side and rear, together with mature trees and established boundaries offering privacy.\n\nFEATURES\n\n- Four-bedroom detached residence\n- Set on approximately 0.50 acres\n- Excellent location convenient to Castlebar and Belcarra\n- Approximately 4 miles from Castlebar\n- Approximately 3 miles from Belcarra\n- Spacious accommodation over two floors\n- Two ground-floor bedrooms\n- Two first-floor bedrooms\n- Sitting room with open fireplace\n- Oil-fired central heating\n- Double glazing\n- Tarmac driveway\n- Large detached garage/outbuilding\n- Excellent workshop and storage potential\n- Mature front, side and rear gardens\n- Mains water and electricity\n- Telephone and broadband passing nearby\n- Property requires refurbishment and redecoration\n- Excellent potential to create a substantial family home\n- Eircode: F23 DY94\n\nLOCATION\n\nLocation is one of the property's strongest attributes. The residence enjoys a peaceful countryside setting while being approximately four miles from Castlebar and three miles from Belcarra.\n\nFor purchasers prepared to undertake refurbishment works, this property provides an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial four-bedroom residence, large detached garage and mature grounds within convenient reach of Castlebar.\n\nGUIDE PRICE: €225,000\n\nVIEWING\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment with the Sole Selling Agents:\n\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENT\n\nDISCLAIMER\n\nThese particulars are issued by Martin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. While every care has been taken in preparing these particulars, they are for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. Measurements, areas and distances are approximate, and intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided.",
